msgid "Relay Shield"
msgstr "Relay Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/relay-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Relay Shield switches two high-power AC or DC loads up to 60 W per relay"
" from the OpenMV Cam, with a 6-36 V input plus an ADC input and a digital "
"I/O line for sync."
msgstr ""
"Relay Shield mengendalikan dua beban AC atau DC berdaya tinggi hingga 60 W "
"per relay dari OpenMV Cam, dengan input 6-36 V ditambah input ADC dan jalur "
"I/O digital untuk sinkronisasi."

